      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Falls%2C_New_Brunswick",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1904, a daredevil from Maine, Van Morrell, crossed the falls on a tightrope, a stunt that still echoes in local lore.",
